{"step_index":3457,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T17:33:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T20:33:57+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T20:33:57+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 89\nTotal Bytes: 6032\nShowing lines 1 to 89\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Walkthrough: Dynamic Summary Formulas, Review Real-time Sync, Global Progress Modal & Production Deployment\n2: \n3: All requested enhancements, bug fixes, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. Dynamic Excel Summary Formulas (`ملخص`)\n8: - **Implemented Dynamic Formulas**:\n9:   - `إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة`: `=B3+B4+B5`\n10:   - `تم مطابقتها`: `=SUM(B8:B{7+N})` (sums warehouse matched counts)\n11:   - `لم يُعثر عليها`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('لم يُعثر عليه'!A:A)-1)`\n12:   - `تحتاج مراجعة`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('يحتاج مراجعة'!A:A)-1)`\n13:   - Warehouse details table (rows 8+):\n14:     - Col 2: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('{sheet}'!A:A)-1)`\n15:     - Col 3: `=COUNTIF('يحتاج مراجعة'!D:D, \"{warehouse_name}\")`\n16:   - Percentages formatted dynamically with `=IF(B2>0, B3/B2, 0)` and formatted as `0.0%`.\n17: - **Confidence Values in Arabic**:\n18:   - Replaced technical codes (`exact`, `high`, `llm`) with professional Arabic terms:\n19:     - `تطابق تام (100%)`\n20:     - `تطابق نصي دقيق (X%)`\n21:     - `مطابقة ذكية (AI)`\n22:     - `تأكيد يدوي (مراجعة)`\n23: \n24: ---\n25: \n26: ## 2. Review Workflow & UI Synchronization\n27: - **Fixed Toast Message (`undefined` bug)**:\n28:   - Fixed toast message in `applyReviews()`: now clearly shows:\n29:     `تم تنفيذ التعديلات! تم اعتماد: X مطابق، Y غير متوفر، والمتبقي للمراجعة: Z`.\n30: - **Instant Stat Cards Refresh**:\n31:   - `backend.apply_reviews` now returns `new_stats` (`total`, `matched_count`, `not_found_count`, `review_count`).\n32:   - Calls `loadResults(result.new_stats)` so the 4 stat cards update on screen immediately without leaving the screen.\n33: - **Excel Synchronization**:\n34:   - `apply_reviews` updates the `ملخص` sheet cells, updates `history.db`, and saves the workbook cleanly.\n35: \n36: ---\n37: \n38: ## 3. Left-Aligned Modal Overlay & Process Queue System (نظام قائمة الانتظار)\n39: - **Left-Side UI Modal Overlay**:\n40:   - Moved `#progress-modal` to `.main-content` with `position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%;`.\n41:   - In RTL layout, it now covers only the left work area (`نص الشمال`), leaving the right sidebar completely accessible and usable at all times.\n42: - **Background Process Queuing (`كيو`)**:\n43:   - When a matching run or re-run is actively running, submitting a new matching process no longer fails or blocks.\n44:   - The new process is automatically saved with status `'queued'` (`في الانتظار`) and added to the backend FIFO queue.\n45:   - The new process submission form resets immediately and displays an informative toast:\n46:     `تمت إضافة العملية إلى قائمة الانتظار (الترتيب #1)، وستبدأ تلقائياً فور انتهاء العملية الحالية.`\n47:   - The History screen displays the queued process with an amber badge `في الانتظار` along with a cancel/delete button.\n48:   - As soon as the active process finishes, a `finally:` block in `_process_worker` automatically pops and executes the next process in queue without requiring manual intervention, and emits `process_queued_started` to notify the frontend.\n49: \n50: ---\n51: \n52: ## 4. Discrepancy Bug Fix (Review Count 9 vs 16)\n53: - **Root Cause**: `FastCoordinator.process()` previously subtracted items matched in other warehouses from `review_count`, yielding 9, whereas `excel_writer.py` wrote all warehouse review candidates to the `يحتاج مراجعة` sheet (16 rows), causing a mismatch between the initial summary and Excel/database.\n54: - **Resolution**: Aligned `coordinator.py` summary statistics to match the exact row count of the Excel sheets (`total_wh_matched`, `total_review_items`, and `total_not_found`).\n55: \n56: ---\n57: \n58: ## 5. Pharmaceutical Rules Tuning in AI Prompt\n59: - **Brand vs Generic / Alternative Substitution**:\n60:   - Drugs with the same active ingredient and strength but different trade names (e.g. Roaccutane vs generic Isotretinoin, or Zovirax vs Lovir) are now correctly routed to **\"يحتاج مراجعة\"** with the reason:\n61:     `\"بديل تجاري / مثيل: نفس المادة الفعالة والتركيز ولكن الاسم التجاري مختلف (المطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\"`.\n62: - **Identical Counts / Manufacturer Suffix**:\n63:   - Equal counts (e.g. 3 ampoules == ٣ امبولات) and items where the only difference is the manufacturer suffix (`/نوفارتس`, `/اكاديميا`) are now recognized as **100% confirmed matches** instead of going to review.\n64: \n65: ---\n66: \n67: ## 6. Complete Environment Cleanup\n68: - Deleted all Unstructured API result files (`transform-result-*.json`).\n69: - Cleared the `processes` history table in `data/history.db`.\n70: - Cleaned out all previous process directories under `data/processes/`.\n71: - Re-packaged a fresh, clean distribution in `dist_production/`.\n72: \n73: ---\n74: \n75: ## 7. Verification Results\n76: \n77: | Component / Test | Result |\n78: | :--- | :--- |\n79: | **Excel Summary Formulas** | PASSED: Dynamic Excel formulas `=B3+B4+B5`, `=SUM(...)`, `=COUNTA(...)` generated and verified |\n80: | **Confidence Arabic Names** | PASSED: Shows `تطابق تام (100%)`, `تطابق نصي دقيق (97%)`, `مطابقة ذكية (AI)` |\n81: | **Review Sync & Toast** | PASSED: Returns `new_stats`, updates cards instantly, no `undefined` in toast |\n82: | **Review Count Alignment** | PASSED: Coordinator summary matches Excel row count (16 == 16) |\n83: | **Left-Side Modal Overlay** | PASSED: Bounded inside `.main-content`, leaves sidebar accessible |\n84: | **Process Queue Mechanics** | PASSED: Tested auto-start from queue (`['PROC-001', 'PROC-002']`) and queue removal |\n85: | **Brand vs Generic Routing** | PASSED: Roaccutane vs Isotretinoin, Zovirax vs Lovir routed to `يحتاج مراجعة` |\n86: | **Identical Count Matching** | PASSED: Voltaren 3 ampoules / Novartis matched directly |\n87: | **Environment Cleanup** | PASSED: History and temporary process files cleaned completely |\n88: | **Production Packaging** | PASSED: Standalone `dist_production/` folder created with `run_app.bat` and `README_SETUP.md` |\n89: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":3458,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T17:33:57Z","thinking":"Parallel execution using a thread pool is required to process warehouse files efficiently. The 22-page Hadaba PDF was parsed successfully, extracting all 1,071 items after addressing timeout issues. A fault-tolerant design incorporating per-file error handling with automatic Gemini 3.6 Flash fallback is essential to prevent pipeline failures.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated walkthrough with Parallel Processing, Hadaba fix, Gemini fallback, and End-to-End verification","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Parallel Processing, Resilient Extraction, Gemini Fallback & Production Deployment\n\nAll requested enhancements, bug fixes, parallel performance optimizations, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Parallel Multi-Threaded File Extraction (المعالجة المتوازية للملفات)\n- **Problem**: Previously, files were uploaded and processed sequentially one-by-one. When processing multiple warehouse catalogs (e.g. 6 PDFs), the total time accumulated to over 30 minutes, and any single network timeout aborted all remaining files.\n- **Solution (`src/extract/file_handler.py`)**:\n  - Implemented `ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=min(len(filepaths), 8))`.\n  - All warehouse files (PDF, Excel, JSON) are now dispatched concurrently in parallel threads.\n  - The Unstructured API accepts concurrent requests, allowing all cloud extraction jobs to run simultaneously.\n  - Finished files are returned, saved, and cached independently as soon as they complete.\n\n---\n\n## 2. 22-Page Hadaba PDF Resolution (`الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf`)\n- **Problem**: \n  - The 22-page Hadaba PDF document timed out on synchronous HTTP requests (> 16 minutes), and when it completed, Unstructured returned 0 items because the data was formatted as an HTML `<table>` in `markdown` rather than `extracted_data`.\n- **Solution (`src/extract/pdf_reader.py`)**:\n  - Extended polling timeout to 24 minutes (180 attempts × 8s) with an initial 20-second fast-wait to prevent hanging synchronous sockets.\n  - Enhanced `parse_structured_result()`:\n    1. First inspects schema `extracted_data`.\n    2. If empty or absent, parses HTML `<table><tr><td>...</td></tr></table>` directly from `result[\"markdown\"]` with automatic column detection (Arabic column headers like `اسم الصنف`, `اسم الدواء`).\n  - **Result**: Successfully extracted **1,071 drug items** with full names, strengths, and pack sizes.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Resilience & Automatic Gemini 3.6 Flash Fallback\n- **Problem**:\n  - If a file returned a 422 Unprocessable Content (e.g. font encoding issue like `جملة العمروووو.pdf`), previous code crashed or returned 0 items.\n- **Solution (`src/extract/pdf_reader.py`)**:\n  - Added isolated `try / except` per worker so a failure in one warehouse NEVER crashes the process or affects other warehouses.\n  - Built an automatic **Gemini 3.6 Flash Fallback Layer**:\n    - If Unstructured API raises an exception or returns 0 items, `_extract_with_gemini_fallback` is triggered automatically.\n    - Successfully extracted all 19 items from `جملة العمروووو.pdf` in seconds.\n    - Saves the result directly to local cache (`.unstructured_cache/` and alongside `.json`), ensuring subsequent runs load instantly.\n\n---\n\n## 4. UI Modal & Queue System Fixes\n- **Modal Left-Alignment**:\n  - `#progress-modal` is constrained inside `<main class=\"main-content\">` with absolute positioning, keeping the right sidebar interactive and accessible during long runs.\n  - Fixed DOM hierarchy closing tags in `desktop_app/templates/index.html`.\n- **Process Queue (`كيو`)**:\n  - Queued runs wait safely in FIFO order and start automatically when the active process finishes.\n\n---\n\n## 5. End-to-End Extraction Verification Across All 6 Warehouses\n\n| Warehouse PDF File | Pages | Extracted Items | Extraction Method | Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **السلام شبين.pdf** | 3 pages | 187 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n| **المكرومي المنصورة.pdf** | 10 pages | 503 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n| **الهضبة الاثنين نقدى0.pdf** | 22 pages | 1,071 items | Unstructured (Markdown Table) | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n| **جملة العمروووو.pdf** | 1 page | 19 items | Unstructured / Gemini 3.6 Fallback | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n| **مخزن الحياة فارم اسكندريه-170.pdf** | 4 pages | 222 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n| **كيور فارما خاص.pdf** | 13 pages | 715 items | Unstructured AI | ✅ Success (Cached) |\n| **TOTAL** | **53 pages** | **2,717 items** | **Concurrent Threads** | ✅ **100% Extracted** |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Updated Production Packaging (`dist_production/`)\n- Successfully synchronized all parallel worker changes, Gemini fallback, UI fixes, and documentation into `dist_production/` via `scripts/package_production.py`.\n- Ready for immediate use and deployment via `run_app.bat`.\n","Description":"Update walkthrough with parallel extraction and verification results","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\kakak\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Update walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Document parallel processing and extraction verification"}}]}
